  Proprietary: docker/sbx-releases states "Copyright 2026 Docker Inc. All
  rights reserved." and grants no licence. No text is copied from them.
  kits/agent-claude/, kits/agent-cursor/, kits/agent-opencode/ and
  kits/agent-devin/ were written in our own words from the public kit
  specification above, checked against how the sbx CLI behaves. They share
  only facts of the protocol with the built-in kits: capability type names,
  hostnames, token endpoints, sentinel values, file paths, the keys each
  agent CLI reads, and release SHA-256 digests.
